            <ArticleTitle>Management and treatment of mucosal melanoma of the genital tract.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>270-273</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.23736/S0392-0488.17.05573-0</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The melanoma of the genital mucosa is a rare melanocytic neoplasm that affects both sexes. The diagnosis is often delayed; videodermatoscopy may represent a useful diagnostic tool. The treatment is complex and multidisciplinary. We report the main diagnostic features and therapeutic approaches for mucosal melanoma of the genital tract.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
